*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_KPI_Site_Reset_with_eCPRI_Fronthaul_Delay_Analysis
    [Documentation]  The test performs a Site Reset with and without the feature enabled (KPI#1a OM_GEN_SFS_PERF_CAP.5294) and verifies whether the 
    ...              eCPRI fronthaul delay measurement is working properly by checking specific messages in the SOAP, PCAP, and Syslog logs.
    ...              !!! FullRack is not supported yet !!!
    ...              Test is based on the following steps:
    ...              - Perform Site Resets in a loop with the feature disabled to calculate the average of the Site Reset duration.
    ...              - Perform Site Resets in a loop with the feature enabled to calculate the average of the Site Reset duration. Additionally,
    ...                in each iteration after site reset verifies, (always) syncStatus and dlMinDelay, ulMinDelay values,
    ...                (optionally) specific messages in the SOAP and PCAP logs.
    ...              - Verifies whether the average duration of a site reset with the feature activated is no more than ${kpi_threshold} longer than
    ...                the average reset duration without the feature.
    ...
    ...              Args
    ...              :param int or list rmod_ids: (Optional):  RMOD ID(s) involved in the test for which SOAP and PCAP logs will be analyzed.
    ...                                                        Default is None with means all RMODs are involved.
    ...              :param int iterations: (Optional):        Number of Site Resets to be performed to calculate average duration. Default is 10.
    ...              :param bool soap_analysis: (Optional):    Whether to perform SOAP analysis. Default is True.
    ...              :param bool pcap_analysis: (Optional):    Whether to perform PCAP analysis. Default is False.
    ...                                                        *Additional hardware (xGen) is required to perform PCAP log collection.
    ...              :param str xgen_config: (Optional):       Configuration dictionary to setup xGen. Mandatory if pcap_analysis == True.
    ...                                                        Default is None.
    ...                                                        The dictionary should contain the following keys:
    ...                                                        - xgen_client_mode: (str) 'remote' or 'local'
    ...                                                        - xgen_client_path: (str) Path to the xGen client executable.
    ...                                                        - xgen_server_ip: (str) IP address of the xGen server.
    ...                                                        - xgen_capture_ports: ports to capture PCAPs from.
    ...                                                        - proxy_ssh: (dict) SSH proxy configuration if remote mode is used.
    ...                                                        - logs_dir: (str) Directory where the logs will be stored.
    ...                                                        Example: {"xgen_client_mode": "remote",
    ...                                                                  "xgen_client_path": "/home/ute/xgen/xgen-client",
    ...                                                                  "xgen_server_ip": "192.168.255.1",
    ...                                                                  "xgen_capture_ports": ["SFP1", "SFP2"],
    ...                                                                  "proxy_ssh": {"host": "10.42.194.208",
    ...                                                                                "username": "ute",
    ...                                                                                "password": "ute"},
    ...                                                                  "logs_dir": "/home/ute/Test/"}
    ...              :param int kpi_threshold: (Optional):     Threshold in seconds indicating the maximum allowed difference between the average 
    ...                                                        duration of a site reset with the feature activated and the average duration 
    ...                                                        of a site reset without the feature. Default is 5.
    [Arguments]      ${rmod_ids}=${None}
    ...              ${iterations}=10
    ...              ${soap_analysis}=${False}
    ...              ${pcap_analysis}=${False}
    ...              ${xgen_config}=${None}
    ...              ${kpi_threshold}=5
    [Timeout]        24 hours

    ${bts_type}=                                        hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection_alias}=                                connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    Set test variable                                   ${connection}                ${connection_alias}
    Set test variable                                   ${soap_logs_path}            ${logs_path}/soap_trace_cfg_logs
    Set test variable                                   ${pcap_logs_path}            ${logs_path}/pcap_logs
    Set test variable                                   ${pcap_filename}             ecpri_msg5.pcap
    config_operations.connect                           alias=${connection}
    ${initial_parameter_value}=                         config_operations.get_parameter_value
    ...                                                 dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
    ...                                                 param_name=actEcpriDelayMeasurement
    IF                                                  ${rmod_ids}==${None}
        ${rmod_ids}=                                    admin_info_model.get_rmod_indexes
        ...                                             connection=${connection}
    ELSE
        ${rmod_ids}=                                    utilities.convert_to_list
        ...                                             data=${rmod_ids}
    END
    ${avrg_duration_without_feature}                    Perform In Loop Site Resets With Feature Deactivated
    ...                                                 iterations=${iterations}

    ${avrg_duration_with_feature}                       Perform In Loop Site Resets With Feature Activated And Verify Logs
    ...                                                 iterations=${iterations}
    ...                                                 rmod_ids=${rmod_ids}
    ...                                                 soap_analysis=${soap_analysis}
    ...                                                 pcap_analysis=${pcap_analysis}
    ...                                                 xgen_config=${xgen_config}
    
    Validate Test Execution Duration                    avrg_without_feature=${avrg_duration_without_feature}
    ...                                                 avrg_with_feature=${avrg_duration_with_feature}
    ...                                                 kpi_threshold=${kpi_threshold}
    
    Robot Log Operation                                 Test finished successfully.
    
    [Teardown]                                          eCPRI Fronthaul Site Reset Teardown
    ...                                                 initial_parameter_value=${initial_parameter_value}
    ...                                                 pcap_analysis=${pcap_analysis}


Perform In Loop Site Resets With Feature Deactivated
    [Documentation]  Performs Site Resets in a loop with the feature disabled to calculate the average of the Site Reset duration.
    ...              KW returns the average duration of the Site Resets executed in loop.
    ...              Start point: first cell down or AdminApi error
    ...              End point: last cell up
    [Arguments]      ${iterations}
    
    Set actEcpriDelayMeasurement Parameter              parameter_value=false
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    
    ${site_resets_elapsed_times}                        Create List    
    Robot Log Operation                                 Starting Site Resets with feature deactivated...
    FOR  ${iteration}                                   IN RANGE  1  (int(${iterations}) + 1)
        Robot Log Operation                             - Iteration ${iteration} of ${iterations} started...
        Allow Alarms Before Site Reset
        admin.reset_site                                timeout=300s
        ...                                             connection=${connection}
        ...                                             wait_for_reconnection=False
        ...                                             graceful_cell_shutdown=True
        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                     2min    1s
        ...                                             Is Any Cell Down Or AdminApi Error
        ...                                             connection=${connection}
        ${start_point}=                                 Get Time
        Robot Log Operation                             - Site reset has been performed, waiting for onAir...
        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                     15min     1 sec
        ...                                             Check statuses of all cells
        ...                                             connection=${connection}
        ${end_point}=                                   Get Time
        Disallow Alarms After Site Reset
        ${time_elapsed}=                                Subtract Date From Date    ${end_point}  ${start_point}
        Append To List                                  ${site_resets_elapsed_times}    ${time_elapsed}
        Robot Log Operation                             - Iteration ${iteration} finished. Execution time: ${time_elapsed}s.
    END
    ${average_site_reset_duration}                      Evaluate   round(sum(${site_resets_elapsed_times}) / len(${site_resets_elapsed_times}), 1)
    Robot Log Operation                                 Site Resets with feature deactivated finished. Average duration: ${average_site_reset_duration}s\n
    Set Test Message                                    Average of Site Reset executions with feature deactivated: ${average_site_reset_duration}s\n
    ...                                                 append=yes
    [Return]  ${average_site_reset_duration}


Perform In Loop Site Resets With Feature Activated And Verify Logs
    [Documentation]  Performs Site Resets in a loop with the feature enabled to calculate the average of the Site Reset duration.
    ...              Optionally, in each iteration after reset, verifies specific messages in the SOAP and PCAP logs.
    ...              KW returns the average duration of the Site Resets executed in loop.
    ...              Start point: first cell down or AdminApi error
    ...              End point: last cell up
    [Arguments]      ${iterations}
    ...              ${rmod_ids}
    ...              ${soap_analysis}
    ...              ${pcap_analysis}
    ...              ${xgen_config}

    Set actEcpriDelayMeasurement Parameter              parameter_value=true
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}

    ${site_resets_elapsed_times}                        Create List    
    Robot Log Operation                                 Starting Site Resets with feature activated...
    IF   ${pcap_analysis}                               
        xgen.setup                                      config=${xgen_config}
    END
    FOR  ${iteration}                                   IN RANGE  1  (int(${iterations}) + 1)
        Robot Log Operation                             - Iteration ${iteration} of ${iterations} started...
        Allow Alarms Before Site Reset
        admin.reset_site                                timeout=300s
        ...                                             connection=${connection}
        ...                                             wait_for_reconnection=False
        ...                                             graceful_cell_shutdown=True             
        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                     2min    1s
        ...                                             Is Any Cell Down Or AdminApi Error
        ...                                             connection=${connection}
        ${start_point}=                                 Get Time
        Robot Log Operation                             - Site reset has been performed, waiting for onAir...
        IF    ${pcap_analysis}                            
            xgen.start_capture_pcap                     pcap_filter=ecpri.msgtype == 0x05
            ...                                         pcap_save_path=${pcap_logs_path}/iteration_${iteration}
            ...                                         pcap_filename=${pcap_filename}
        END
        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                     15min     1 sec
        ...                                             Check statuses of all cells
        ...                                             connection=${connection}
        ${end_point}=                                   Get Time
        Disallow Alarms After Site Reset
        ${time_elapsed}=                                Subtract Date From Date    ${end_point}  ${start_point}
        Append To List                                  ${site_resets_elapsed_times}    ${time_elapsed}
        Perform SyncStatus And DL UL Minimum Delay Validation
        ...                                             rmod_ids=${rmod_ids}
        ...                                             connection=${connection}

        IF                                              ${soap_analysis} or ${pcap_analysis}
            ${rmods_info}=                              Prepare RMODs Dict With Required Info
            ...                                         rmod_ids=${rmod_ids}
            ...                                         connection=${connection}
            Collect Logs                                collect_soap=${soap_analysis}
            ...                                         collect_pcap=${pcap_analysis}
            ...                                         rmods_info=${rmods_info}
            ...                                         iteration=iteration_${iteration}
            Verify Logs                                 soap_analysis=${soap_analysis}
            ...                                         pcap_analysis=${pcap_analysis}
            ...                                         rmods_info=${rmods_info}
            ...                                         iteration=iteration_${iteration}
        END
        Robot Log Operation                             - Iteration ${iteration} finished. Execution time: ${time_elapsed}s.
    END
    ${average_site_reset_duration}                      Evaluate   round(sum(${site_resets_elapsed_times}) / len(${site_resets_elapsed_times}), 1)
    Robot Log Operation                                 Site Resets with feature activated finished. Average duration: ${average_site_reset_duration}s\n
    Set Test Message                                    Average of Site Reset executions with feature activated: ${average_site_reset_duration}s\n
    ...                                                 append=yes
    [Return]  ${average_site_reset_duration}


Is Any Cell Down Or AdminApi Error
    [Documentation]  Checks if any cell is down or AdminApi error occurred.
    [Arguments]      ${connection}
    
    ${is_any_cell_down_status}=                         Run Keyword And Ignore Error
    ...                                                 status_check.verify_if_any_cell_down
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ${is_admin_api_failure}=                            evaluate  "AdminApiFailure" in """${is_any_cell_down_status}[1]"""
    ${is_admin_api_procedure_failure}=                  evaluate  "AdminApiProcedureFailureException:" in """${is_any_cell_down_status}[1]"""

    IF                                                  '${is_any_cell_down_status}[0]' == 'PASS'
        Log                                             PASS, at least one cell is down.
    ELSE IF  '${is_any_cell_down_status}[0]' == 'FAIL' and (${is_admin_api_failure} or ${is_admin_api_procedure_failure})
        Log                                             PASS, AdminApi error occurred.
    ELSE
        Fail                                            No cell is down, or no AdminApi error occurred.
    END


eCPRI Fronthaul Site Reset Teardown
    [Documentation]  Test teardown.
    [Arguments]      ${initial_parameter_value}
    ...              ${pcap_analysis}
    IF   ${pcap_analysis}                               xgen.close
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                         15min     1 sec
    ...                                                 Check statuses of all cells
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    Restore Parameter actEcpriDelayMeasurement To Initial
    ...                                                 initial_parameter_value=${initial_parameter_value}


Allow Alarms Before Site Reset
    [Documentation]  Allows alarms before site reset.
    Allow DSS alarms
    Allow X2 Link Alarms


Disallow Alarms After Site Reset
    [Documentation]  Disallows alarms after site reset.
    Disallow DSS alarms
    Disallow X2 Link Alarms
